ft" valign="top" rowspan="13" colspan="1">Double-blind factorial study</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="13" colspan="1">N = 1714<break/>Average age: 57<break/>SBP 160&#x02013;190 mmHg</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="13" colspan="1">AZ 0, 20, 40, 80 mg and/or Chlor 0, 12.5, 25 mg</td><td colspan="3" align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1">Reduction in mean SBP (measured by 24 hours ABPM) in 8 weeks</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="13" colspan="1">Serum creatinine increase (0.6%&#x02013;5%), dizziness (1.3%&#x02013;13.5%), headache (0.7%&#x02013;12.2%), increase uric acid (2.7%&#x02013;32.9%)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1">AZ(mg)/Chlor(mg)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">12.5</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;21.2 mmHg<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn4-ibpc-6-039">&#x02260;</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">25</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;27.1 mmHg<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn4-ibpc-6-039">&#x02260;</xref>,<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn5-ibpc-6-039">&#x003a9;</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">20</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;19.8 mmHg</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">20</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">12.5</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;33.8 mmHg<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn4-ibpc-6-039">&#x02260;</xref>,<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn5-ibpc-6-039">&#x003a9;</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">20</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">25</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;37 mmHg<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn4-ibpc-6-039">&#x02260;</xref>,<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn5-ibpc-6-039">&#x003a9;</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">40</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;23.3 mmHg</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">40</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">12.5</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;36.8 mmHg<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn4-ibpc-6-039">&#x02260;</xref>,<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn5-ibpc-6-039">&#x003a9;</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">40</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">25</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;39.6 mmHg<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn4-ibpc-6-039">&#x02260;</xref>,<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn5-ibpc-6-039">&#x003a9;</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">80</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;24.2 mmHg</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">80</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">12.5</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;36.9 mmHg<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn4-ibpc-6-039">&#x02260;</xref>,<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn5-ibpc-6-039">&#x003a9;</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">80</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">25</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;40.1 mmHg<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn4-ibpc-6-039">&#x02260;</xref>,<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn5-ibpc-6-039">&#x003a9;</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Cushman et al<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b22-ibpc-6-039">22</xref></td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Double-blind, randomized</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">N = 1071<break/>Average age: 57<break/>SBP 160&#x02013;190 mmHg</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">AZ/Chlor 40/25 mg<break/>AZ/Chlor 80/25 mg<break/>Olm/HCTZ 40/25</td><td colspan="3" align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1">Reduction in mean SBP (measured by 24 hours ABPM) in 12 weeks<break/>AZ/Chlor 40/25 mg: &#x02212;42.5 mmHg<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn3-ibpc-6-039">^</xref><break/>AZ/Chlor 80/25 mg: &#x02212;44.5 mmHg<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn3-ibpc-6-039">^</xref><break/>Olm/HCTZ 40/25 mg: &#x02212;37.1 mmHg</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Increase in serum creatinine: 18.6%&#x02013;22.2%<break/>Dizziness: 11.5%&#x02013;16.5%<break/>Increase in uric acid: 4.8%&#x02013;5.4%</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Bakris et al<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b23-ibpc-6-039">23</xref></td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Double-blind, randomized</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">N = 609<break/>Average age: 56.4<break/>SBP 160&#x02013;190 mmHg</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">AZ 40 mg + Chlor or HCTZ 12.5&#x02013;25 mg</td><td colspan="3" align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1">Reduction of clinic SBP in 6 weeks<break/>AZ/Chlor: &#x02212;31.5 mmHg<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn2-ibpc-6-039">*</xref><break/>AZ/HCTZ: &#x02212;29.5 mmHg</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Dizziness: 12.3%<break/>Increase in serum creatinine: 12.9%<break/>Headache: 5.3%</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">491-CLD-301<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b24-ibpc-6-039">24</xref></td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Double-blind, randomized</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">N = 1085<break/>Age &#x0003e;18 years<break/>SBP 160&#x02013;190 mmHg</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">AZ/Chlor 40/25 mg<break/>AZ/Chlor 80/25 mg<break/>Olm/HCTZ 40/25</td><td colspan="3" align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1">Reduction of clinic SBP in 12 weeks<break/>AZ/Chlor 40/25 mg: &#x02212;38 mmHg<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn3-ibpc-6-039">^</xref><break/>AZ/Chlor 80/25 mg: &#x02212;38 mmHg<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn3-ibpc-6-039">^</xref><break/>Olm/HCTZ 40/25 mg: &#x02212;32 mmHg</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Increase in serum creatinine (2.5%), fatigue (3.8%), hypotension (1.1%).</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">01-05-TL-491-009<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b24-ibpc-6-039">24</xref></td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Double-blind, randomized, controlled</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">N = 551<break/>Average age: 58<break/>SBP 160&#x02013;190 mmHg</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Chlor 25 mg<break/>AZ 40 mg + Chlor 25 mg<break/>AZ 80 mg + Chlor 25 mg 6 weeks</td><td colspan="3" align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1">Compared to placebo (mean SBP [measured by 24 hours ABPM] change): Chlor 25 mg: &#x02212;16 mmHg<break/>AZ 40 mg + Chlor<break/>25 mg: &#x02212;31.75 mmHg<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn4-ibpc-6-039">&#x02260;</xref><break/>AZ 80 mg + Chlor<break/>25 mg: &#x02212;31.3 mmHg<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn4-ibpc-6-039">&#x02260;</xref></td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">More common side effect of AZ: hypotension (5 patients), dizziness (4 patients)<break/>Increase in creatinine: AZ 40 mg: 7.7%, 80 mg: 7.9%, Chlor monotherapy: 2.2%</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn1-ibpc-6-039"><p><bold>Notes:</bold></p></fn><fn id="tfn2-ibpc-6-039"><label>*</label><p><italic>P</italic> &#x0003c; 0.05 compared to azilsartan/HCTZ;</p></fn><fn id="tfn3-ibpc-6-039"><label>^</label><p><italic>P</italic> &#x0003c; 0.05 compared to olmesartan/HCTZ;</p></fn><fn id="tfn4-ibpc-6-039"><label>&#x02260;</label><p><italic>P</italic> &#x0003c; 0.05 compared to chlorthalidone alone;</p></fn><fn id="tfn5-ibpc-6-039"><label>&#x003a9;</label><p><italic>P</italic> &#x0003c; 0.05 compared to azilsartan alone.</p></fn><fn id="tfn6-ibpc-6-039"><p><bold>Abbreviations:</bold> ABPM, ambulatory blood pressure monitoring; AZ, azilsartan; Chlor, chlorthalidone; Olm, olmesartan; HCTZ, hydrochlorothiazide; SBP, systolic blood pressure.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="t2-ibpc-6-039" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>Comparative cost (average wholesale price) of angiotensin receptor blocker-diuretic combination used in the United States<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b24-ibpc-6-039">24</xref></p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Antihypertensives</th><th align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Cost for 30-day supply (US$)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td colspan="2" align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1">Azilsartan/chlorthalidone tablet</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;40&#x02013;12.5 mg</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">109.60</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;40&#x02013;25 mg</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">109.60</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1">Candesartan/hydrochlorothiazide tablet</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;16&#x02013;12.5 mg</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">368.18</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;32&#x02013;12.5 mg</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">375.51</td